{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41986","headline":"暮春有感寄宋维员外 · 李中","name":"暮春有感寄宋维员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杜宇声中老病心，此心无计驻光阴。\n西园雨过好花尽，南陌人稀芳草深。\n喧梦却嫌莺语老，伴吟惟怕月轮沈。\n明年才候东风至，结驷期君预去寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}